WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:22.490
Mukati mechibereko, mwana asati aberekwa anokomberedzwa nokunzwika kwakapfava uye kunodzikama, kubatanidza kwavo

2
00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:31.870
kurova kwemoyo waamai uye digestive system nemanzwi nemanzwi kubva kunze kwenyika. As

3
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:38.750
nhumbu inosvika padanho rekupedzisira, maziso emwana anogona kuvhurika mukati mechibereko. Nepo vasingakwanise

4
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:46.950
asi vanoona mifananidzo kana ruzivo, vanogona kuona shanduko muchiedza. Saka, nepo hupenyu huri mudumbu husina kujeka

5
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:56.840
uye yakasviba, iri kure nekunyarara. Kuberekwa ishanduko huru kumwana. Vanoerekana vapinda

6
00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:03.820
nyika izere nezvitsva, zvinopenya zvinopenya uye neruzha. Kuchinjira kunyika itsva ino inzwa

7
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:10.340
kumutsa iyo kick-inotanga kukura kwavo. Mumavhiki mashomanana ekutanga ehupenyu, mwana achazviita

8
00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.200
kuvhunduka uye kumuka kana pane ruzha. Meso avo anonzwa kupenya kuchiedza,

9
00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:25.330
asi vachiri kuona zvishoma. Chiono chavo, zvisinei, chinotanga kukura zvakanyanya

10
00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:33.240
rate. Mumavhiki maviri, kuona kwakavandudzika zvakanyanya. Ivo zvino vanogona kuona zvimwe zvakadzama, kunyanya

11
00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:39.780
kana zvinhu zviri pedyo. Hapana ruvara, uye zvavanoona zvakati sandara nekuti maziso avo

12
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:45.880
havasati vagara vakatwasuka uye vachishanda pamwechete kuti vaone zvakadzama. Dzimwe nguva maziso avo

13
00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.730
ichakukurwa mukati kana kubuda kwenguva pfupi. Uku kunonzi kutswinya. Izvi zvinofanira kumira kuitika

14
00:01:52.730 --> 00:02:00.340
nemwedzi mitatu. Mumwedzi mumwe chete, chiono chemavara chiri kutanga kukura. Vachava vakawanda

15
00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:06.160
kunyanya kuona, kunyanya kune zviso. Vanozotangawo kuedza kutevera zvinhu

16
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:13.030
zviri kufamba. Vachawedzera kuziva manzwi akajairika, kusanganisira anozivikanwa zvikuru

17
00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:19.450
manzwi, semhuri yavo, uye votanga kubatanidza zvavanonzwa nezvavanonzwa

18
00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:24.820
maona. Mumwedzi mitatu, maziso avo anofanira kugara akatwasuka uye achishanda pamwe chete kugadzira

19
00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:31.620
3D kuona. Aya maonero matsva akadzama anovabatsira kusvika kune zvinhu nemazvo. Ivo

20
00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:37.240
uchakwanisa kutevera zvinhu zviri kufamba nekukurumidza. Panguva imwe cheteyo, manzwi ane revo

21
00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:45.420
zvichatanga kugadzirwa. Mumwedzi mitanhatu, mwana anofanira kukwanisa kuziva vanhu vanoziva

22
00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.960
nezviso zvavo uye nemanzwi avo. Vanogonawo kutanga kuona zvinhu zviri mberi

23
00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:57.880
kure. Vanosundwa nekuda kuziva, vanosvika kune zvinhu, kukambaira vakananga kwavari, uye, vachitenderera

24
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:03.760
zuva ravo rekuzvarwa rekutanga, famba. Kubhuya kwavo kuri kukura uye manzwi anozova ekutanga

25
00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:13.460
mazwi panguva ino zvakare. Pakazosvika mwedzi gumi nemisere, kuona kunenge kwaita munhu mukuru, kunyange zvakadaro

26
00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:20.520
blurry zvishoma. Vachakwanisa kuziva zita ravo uye kushandisa mamwe mazwi.

27
00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:28.300
Vamwe vacheche vangasakwanisa kuita izvi zvinhanho zvekukura panguva inotarisirwa. Variko

28
00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:34.210
zvikonzero zvakawanda zveizvi, uye vazhinji vachazvigadzirisa. Somuenzaniso, vana vasati vasvika

29
00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:40.920
inogona kuva nekunonoka, asi kazhinji kubata gare gare muhuduku. Kune vamwe, panogona kunge paine kuramba

30
00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:47.710
matambudziko. Kuziva izvi nekukurumidza sezvinobvira kupa kurapwa nerutsigiro kunogona

31
00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.210
kuwedzera budiriro.
